1
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:08,000
So, this is the answer to all the riddles.

2
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:12,920
Here in the wild I have you.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,420
Two halflings and a host of men at my call.

4
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:25,200
The ring of power within my grasp.

5
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:38,250
A chance for Faramir, Captain of Gondor,

6
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:42,920
to show his quality.

7
00:00:48,460 --> 00:00:49,520
No!

8
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:54,220
Don't you understand?

9
00:00:56,300 --> 00:00:59,950
He's got to destroy it!
Osgiliath is under attack.

10
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,540
They call for reinforcements.

11
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:02,620
Please.

12
00:01:03,560 --> 00:01:04,940
It's such a burden.

13
00:01:06,640 --> 00:01:08,400
Will you not help him?

14
00:01:10,300 --> 00:01:11,120
Captain.

15
00:01:12,740 --> 00:01:14,060
Prepare to leave.
